Next Steps

If you're currently on a trial, please upgrade your trial Enterprise (Enterprises → select your Enterprise → Activate Enterprise) to unlock the full product experience. Please disregard the payment confirmation screen and select "Activate paid Enterprise." Your platform credits will automatically begin to apply and you will not be charged until the credits expire.

Tracking your credits

As an Enterprise account admin, you can monitor credit usage anytime in your Billing overview dashboard:

1. Navigate to your Enterprise's 'Billing and Licensing' Tab
2. Stay on the 'Overview' Tab
3. Click "More details" in the Current included usage tile

About your credits

Credits are valid through <%= @credit_expiry_date %> and apply to metered products enabled on your Enterprise account including:

- GitHub Enterprise licenses
- GitHub Copilot Business or Enterprise (including premium features)
- GitHub Advanced Security
- Add-ons such as Larger Runners and Codespaces

Once credits are fully consumed—or once the 12-month program period ends—billing will automatically transition to the payment method on file. At that time, standard rates will apply to any products enabled on your Enterprise.

